---
import CarbonLayout from "../../layouts/CarbonLayout.astro";
import AOSInit from "../../components/AOSInit.astro";
import { getRelatedPosts } from "../../data/blogPosts.js";
import NewsletterPopup from "../../components/NewsletterPopup.astro";

export const prerender = true;

// For the featured cost post, link to other Cost & Savings articles
const relatedPostSlugs = [
  "cost-saving-tips",
  "uninsured-imaging-guide",
  "price-transparency-healthcare",
];

// Get the full post data automatically from blogPosts.js
const relatedArticles = getRelatedPosts("real-cost-of-mri", relatedPostSlugs);
---

<CarbonLayout
  title="The Real Cost of an MRI: What Hospitals Don't Want You to Know | USRad"
  description="Discover why the same MRI costs $3,000 at hospitals but only $260 elsewhere. Learn how to avoid overpriced imaging without sacrificing quality."
>
  <AOSInit />

  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section
    class="relative bg-gradient-to-br from-red-50 via-white to-orange-50/30 pt-24 pb-16 overflow-hidden"
  >
    <!-- Subtle background pattern -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-40">
      <div
        class="absolute top-20 right-20 w-72 h-72 bg-red-200 rounded-full mix-blend-multiply filter blur-3xl animate-blob"
      >
      </div>
      <div
        class="absolute top-40 left-20 w-72 h-72 bg-orange-200 rounded-full mix-blend-multiply filter blur-3xl animate-blob animation-delay-2000"
      >
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative">
      <!-- Breadcrumb -->
      <nav class="mb-8" data-aos="fade-up">
        <ol class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600">
          <li>
            <a href="/blog" class="hover:text-[#003087] transition">Blog</a>
          </li>
          <li><span class="text-gray-400">/</span></li>
          <li class="text-gray-900 font-medium">The Real Cost of an MRI</li>
        </ol>
      </nav>

      <!-- Title Section -->
      <div class="max-w-3xl" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
        <div
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-red-100 text-red-700 rounded-full text-sm font-medium mb-6"
        >
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
            <path
              fill-rule="evenodd"
              d="M18 10a8 8 0 11-16 0 8 8 0 0116 0zm-7 4a1 1 0 11-2 0 1 1 0 012 0zm-1-9a1 1 0 00-1 1v4a1 1 0 102 0V6a1 1 0 00-1-1z"
              clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
          </svg>
          Cost Transparency • Featured Article
        </div>

        <h1
          class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 leading-tight"
        >
          The Real Cost of an MRI: What Hospitals Don't Want You to Know
        </h1>

        <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-8">
          A $3,000 hospital MRI or a $260 USRad scan—what's the difference?
          Everything, and nothing. Discover how to avoid overpriced imaging
          without sacrificing quality.
        </p>

        <!-- Author & Date -->
        <div
          class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-6 pb-8 border-b border-gray-200"
        >
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <img
              src="/images/michael.webp"
              alt="Michael Cabrera"
              class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full ring-2 ring-blue-100"
            />
            <div>
              <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Michael Cabrera</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Founder & CEO, USRad</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-600">
            <span>August 5, 2025</span>
            <span>•</span>
            <span>6 min read</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Main Content -->
  <article class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <!-- Key Takeaway Banner -->
      <div
        class="bg-gradient-to-r from-red-600 to-orange-600 rounded-2xl p-8 mb-12 text-white"
        data-aos="fade-up"
      >
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3">💥 The Shocking Truth</h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-red-50">
          You walk into a hospital for an MRI. You walk out with a <strong
            >$3,000 bill</strong
          >. Someone else gets the <em>same</em> scan through USRad—starting at <strong
            >$260</strong
          >. Same machine. Same radiologist credentials. A multi-thousand-dollar
          difference.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Featured Image Section -->
      <div class="mb-12" data-aos="fade-up">
        <div
          class="relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-gray-100 aspect-[3/4] md:aspect-[4/5] lg:aspect-[5/6]"
        >
          <img
            src="/images/blog/cost-comparison.webp"
            alt="MRI cost comparison - hospital vs independent imaging center"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover"
          />
          <div
            class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/30 to-transparent"
          >
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 text-center mt-3 italic">
          The same MRI scan can cost anywhere from $260 to $3,000+ depending on
          where you go
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Introduction -->
      <section class="prose prose-lg max-w-none mb-16" data-aos="fade-up">
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          It's one of the healthcare system's most painful secrets—and it's
          driving millions of uninsured and underinsured Americans away from
          care. But understanding why these price differences exist gives you
          the power to make smarter healthcare decisions.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Content Section 1: Why So Expensive -->
      <section class="prose prose-lg max-w-none mb-16" data-aos="fade-up">
        <h2
          class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 flex items-center gap-3"
        >
          <span
            class="w-10 h-10 bg-gradient-to-br from-red-600 to-orange-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-white text-xl font-bold shrink-0"
            >1</span
          >
          Why Is the Same MRI So Expensive at the Hospital?
        </h2>

        <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          <p class="text-lg">
            Most people assume that higher cost = higher quality. But when it
            comes to medical imaging, that logic fails. Hospitals and outpatient
            imaging centers often use the <strong>exact same machines</strong> and
            <strong>board-certified radiologists</strong>.
          </p>

          <div class="space-y-6 my-8">
            <!-- Facility Fees -->
            <div
              class="bg-white border-l-4 border-red-500 p-6 rounded-r-lg shadow-sm"
            >
              <h3
                class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2"
              >
                <span class="text-2xl">1</span>
                Facility Fees
              </h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 mb-2">
                Hospitals add a <strong>"facility fee"</strong>—a charge for
                being seen at their location. This alone can add <strong
                  >hundreds to over $1,000</strong
                > to your bill, even though the actual imaging equipment and process
                is identical to what you'd get at an independent center.
              </p>
              <div class="bg-red-50 rounded-lg p-4 mt-3">
                <p class="text-sm text-red-800 font-semibold">
                  Average facility fee: $800-$1,500 per MRI
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Insurance-Driven Inflation -->
            <div
              class="bg-white border-l-4 border-orange-500 p-6 rounded-r-lg shadow-sm"
            >
              <h3
                class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2"
              >
                <span class="text-2xl">2</span>
                Insurance-Driven Price Inflation
              </h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 mb-2">
                Hospitals negotiate higher prices with insurers to maximize
                reimbursement. But <strong>uninsured patients get stuck</strong>
                with these inflated list prices—called "chargemaster" rates—which
                can be 2-5x higher than what insurance companies actually pay.
              </p>
              <div
                class="bg-blue-50 border-l-4 border-blue-500 p-4 rounded-r-lg mt-3"
              >
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">
                  <strong>📊 2023 Health Care Cost Institute Study:</strong> The
                  average hospital MRI is over <strong>$1,100</strong>, compared
                  to <strong>under $500</strong> at independent centers.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Unbundled Billing -->
            <div
              class="bg-white border-l-4 border-yellow-500 p-6 rounded-r-lg shadow-sm"
            >
              <h3
                class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2"
              >
                <span class="text-2xl">3</span>
                Unbundled Billing
              </h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 mb-2">
                Hospitals often <strong>unbundle</strong> the scan, contrast dye,
                and radiologist read—each billed separately. This means:
              </p>
              <ul class="space-y-1 text-gray-700 text-sm mt-2">
                <li>• Facility fee: $1,200</li>
                <li>• MRI scan: $800</li>
                <li>• Contrast dye: $400</li>
                <li>• Radiologist read: $300</li>
                <li>
                  • <strong class="text-lg">Total surprise bill: $2,700+</strong
                  >
                </li>
              </ul>
              <div class="bg-green-50 rounded-lg p-4 mt-3">
                <p class="text-sm text-green-800">
                  <strong>✓ USRad Solution:</strong> Bundled, transparent pricing
                  means you know the full cost upfront—no surprise bills.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div
            class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-50 to-white rounded-2xl p-8 my-8 border border-gray-200"
          >
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">
              The Hidden Cost Breakdown
            </h3>
            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
              <div>
                <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-red-700 mb-3">
                  Hospital MRI ($3,000)
                </p>
                <div class="space-y-2">
                  <div class="flex justify-between text-sm">
                    <span class="text-gray-600">Facility Fee</span>
                    <span class="font-semibold">$1,200</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex justify-between text-sm">
                    <span class="text-gray-600">Scan</span>
                    <span class="font-semibold">$900</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex justify-between text-sm">
                    <span class="text-gray-600">Contrast</span>
                    <span class="font-semibold">$500</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex justify-between text-sm">
                    <span class="text-gray-600">Radiologist</span>
                    <span class="font-semibold">$400</span>
                  </div>
                  <div
                    class="flex justify-between text-sm pt-2 border-t border-gray-300"
                  >
                    <span class="text-gray-900 font-bold">Total</span>
                    <span class="font-bold text-red-600">$3,000</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-green-700 mb-3">
                  USRad MRI ($260-$600)
                </p>
                <div class="space-y-2">
                  <div class="flex justify-between text-sm">
                    <span class="text-gray-600">All-Inclusive Bundle</span>
                    <span class="font-semibold">$260-$600</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-2">
                    ✓ Scan<br />
                    ✓ Contrast (if needed)<br />
                    ✓ Radiologist read<br />
                    ✓ No facility fees<br />
                    ✓ No surprise bills
                  </div>
                  <div
                    class="flex justify-between text-sm pt-2 border-t border-gray-300"
                  >
                    <span class="text-gray-900 font-bold">Savings</span>
                    <span class="font-bold text-green-600">$2,400-$2,740</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Content Section 2: Real Patient Story -->
      <section class="prose prose-lg max-w-none mb-16" data-aos="fade-up">
        <h2
          class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 flex items-center gap-3"
        >
          <span
            class="w-10 h-10 bg-gradient-to-br from-red-600 to-orange-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-white text-xl font-bold shrink-0"
            >2</span
          >
          Real Patient Story: Ashley's $2,373 Savings
        </h2>

        <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          <div
            class="bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 to-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-blue-200"
          >
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 mb-4">
              <div
                class="w-16 h-16 bg-blue-200 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-2xl shrink-0"
              >
                👩‍💼
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">Ashley, 34</h3>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">
                  Self-employed graphic designer
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-4">
              <p class="text-gray-700">
                <strong>The Problem:</strong> Ashley injured her knee while hiking.
                Her doctor ordered an MRI to check for ligament damage. As a freelancer
                with a high-deductible health plan, she knew she'd be paying out
                of pocket.
              </p>

              <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded-lg p-4">
                  <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-red-800 mb-2">
                    ❌ Hospital Quote
                  </p>
                  <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-red-600 mb-1">$3,018</p>
                  <p class="text-xs text-gray-600">
                    Not including radiologist fee
                  </p>
                  <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 mt-1">Wait time: 2 weeks</p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-lg p-4">
                  <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-green-800 mb-2">
                    ✓ USRad Quote
                  </p>
                  <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-green-600 mb-1">$645</p>
                  <p class="text-xs text-gray-600">
                    All-inclusive, bundled price
                  </p>
                  <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 mt-1">Wait time: 48 hours</p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div
                class="bg-yellow-50 border-l-4 border-[#cc9933] p-4 rounded-r-lg"
              >
                <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900">
                  Ashley's Savings: <span class="text-[#cc9933] text-xl"
                    >$2,373</span
                  >
                </p>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 mt-1">
                  Same scan. Same image quality. Scheduled within 48 hours.
                </p>
              </div>

              <p class="text-gray-700 italic">
                "I couldn't believe the price difference. The imaging center was
                modern, the staff was professional, and I got my results just as
                fast as I would have at the hospital. I saved enough to cover
                three months of health insurance premiums."
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Content Section 3: Price Transparency -->
      <section class="prose prose-lg max-w-none mb-16" data-aos="fade-up">
        <h2
          class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 flex items-center gap-3"
        >
          <span
            class="w-10 h-10 bg-gradient-to-br from-red-600 to-orange-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-white text-xl font-bold shrink-0"
            >3</span
          >
          Why Price Transparency Matters
        </h2>

        <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          <p class="text-lg">
            You wouldn't buy a car or plane ticket without knowing the price
            first. But in healthcare, mystery billing is the norm—and it costs
            patients thousands.
          </p>

          <div
            class="bg-gradient-to-br from-[#003087] to-blue-700 rounded-2xl p-8 text-white my-8"
          >
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6">The USRad Difference</h3>
            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
              <div class="space-y-4">
                <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                  <svg
                    class="w-6 h-6 text-green-300 shrink-0 mt-0.5"
                    fill="currentColor"
                    viewBox="0 0 20 20"
                  >
                    <path
                      fill-rule="evenodd"
                      d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z"
                      clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
                  </svg>
                  <div>
                    <p class="font-semibold mb-1">Upfront Pricing</p>
                    <p class="text-sm text-blue-100">
                      Know the exact cost before you book—no surprises
                    </p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                  <svg
                    class="w-6 h-6 text-green-300 shrink-0 mt-0.5"
                    fill="currentColor"
                    viewBox="0 0 20 20"
                  >
                    <path
                      fill-rule="evenodd"
                      d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z"
                      clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
                  </svg>
                  <div>
                    <p class="font-semibold mb-1">No Insurance Required</p>
                    <p class="text-sm text-blue-100">
                      Our cash prices are often lower than insurance rates
                    </p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                  <svg
                    class="w-6 h-6 text-green-300 shrink-0 mt-0.5"
                    fill="currentColor"
                    viewBox="0 0 20 20"
                  >
                    <path
                      fill-rule="evenodd"
                      d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z"
                      clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
                  </svg>
                  <div>
                    <p class="font-semibold mb-1">Bundled Pricing</p>
                    <p class="text-sm text-blue-100">
                      Everything included—scan, contrast, and radiologist read
                    </p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="space-y-4">
                <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                  <svg
                    class="w-6 h-6 text-green-300 shrink-0 mt-0.5"
                    fill="currentColor"
                    viewBox="0 0 20 20"
                  >
                    <path
                      fill-rule="evenodd"
                      d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z"
                      clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
                  </svg>
                  <div>
                    <p class="font-semibold mb-1">Same Quality Equipment</p>
                    <p class="text-sm text-blue-100">
                      High-field 1.5T and 3T MRI machines, same as hospitals
                    </p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                  <svg
                    class="w-6 h-6 text-green-300 shrink-0 mt-0.5"
                    fill="currentColor"
                    viewBox="0 0 20 20"
                  >
                    <path
                      fill-rule="evenodd"
                      d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z"
                      clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
                  </svg>
                  <div>
                    <p class="font-semibold mb-1">
                      Board-Certified Radiologists
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-sm text-blue-100">
                      Your results read by experienced, certified specialists
                    </p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                  <svg
                    class="w-6 h-6 text-green-300 shrink-0 mt-0.5"
                    fill="currentColor"
                    viewBox="0 0 20 20"
                  >
                    <path
                      fill-rule="evenodd"
                      d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z"
                      clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
                  </svg>
                  <div>
                    <p class="font-semibold mb-1">Starting at Just $260</p>
                    <p class="text-sm text-blue-100">
                      Pricing varies by location and scan type
                    </p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Content Section 4: How to Save -->
      <section class="prose prose-lg max-w-none mb-16" data-aos="fade-up">
        <h2
          class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 flex items-center gap-3"
        >
          <span
            class="w-10 h-10 bg-gradient-to-br from-red-600 to-orange-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-white text-xl font-bold shrink-0"
            >4</span
          >
          How to Save on Your Next MRI
        </h2>

        <div class="space-y-6 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          <!-- Ask Right Questions -->
          <div
            class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-[#003087] transition"
          >
            <h3
              class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2"
            >
              <span class="text-2xl">💬</span>
              Ask the Right Questions
            </h3>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-700">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-[#003087] font-bold mt-1">•</span>
                <span
                  >What's the <strong>total cost</strong> of this MRI, including
                  the radiologist fee and contrast?</span
                >
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-[#003087] font-bold mt-1">•</span>
                <span>Is this price the same with or without insurance?</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-[#003087] font-bold mt-1">•</span>
                <span>Can I get that quote <strong>in writing</strong>?</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-[#003087] font-bold mt-1">•</span>
                <span>Are there any additional fees I should know about?</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <!-- Compare Facilities -->
          <div
            class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-[#003087] transition"
          >
            <h3
              class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2"
            >
              <span class="text-2xl">🔍</span>
              Compare Facilities
            </h3>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-700">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-[#003087] font-bold mt-1">•</span>
                <span
                  >Look for <strong>ACR-accredited centers</strong> (American College
                  of Radiology)</span
                >
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-[#003087] font-bold mt-1">•</span>
                <span
                  >Ask about machine specs: <strong>1.5T or 3T MRI</strong> is ideal
                  for most scans</span
                >
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-[#003087] font-bold mt-1">•</span>
                <span
                  >Confirm radiologist credentials: <strong
                    >Board-certified</strong
                  > and subspecialty trained</span
                >
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
